{"id":"a713bbaa5e1d7ea4","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-ifp.md","title":"膨胀不动点 IFP","display":"df-ifp — 膨胀不动点 IFP","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-ifp","aliases":["29-df-ifp"],"display":"df-ifp — 膨胀不动点 IFP","depends_on":[],"source_locator":"§9.1, Eq.(9.7), pp.142–143, DjVu scans 157–158","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；陈述已对照，证明核对范围见 Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-ifp"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-ifp</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ifp — 膨胀不动点 IFP"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"§9.1, Eq.(9.7), pp.142–143, DjVu scans 157–158"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 隐藏文本层；陈述已对照，证明核对范围见 Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 为有限集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:\\mathcal P(U)\\to\\mathcal P(U)\">\\(F:\\mathcal P(U)\\to\\mathcal P(U)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 不要求单调。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(i\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I_0^F\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad I_{i+1}^F\\coloneqq I_i^F\\cup F(I_i^F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I_0^F\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad I_{i+1}^F\\coloneqq I_i^F\\cup F(I_i^F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IFP}_U(F)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i\\in\\mathbb N}I_i^F.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IFP}_U(F)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i\\in\\mathbb N}I_i^F.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists r\\leq|U|\\quad I_r^F=I_{r+1}^F=\\operatorname{IFP}_U(F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists r\\leq|U|\\quad I_r^F=I_{r+1}^F=\\operatorname{IFP}_U(F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §9.1 式 (9.7)，印刷页 142–143，扫描页 157–158。链因显式并入旧关系而递增，至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|U|\">\\(|U|\\)</span> 次严格增长，故定义良定。非单调时，输出只是膨胀算子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\mapsto X\\cup F(X)\">\\(X\\mapsto X\\cup F(X)\\)</span> 从空集迭代的稳定值，不宣称它为该算子的最小不动点。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"F:\\mathcal P(U)\\to\\mathcal P(U)","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"I_0^F\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad I_{i+1}^F\\coloneqq I_i^F\\cup F(I_i^F).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IFP}_U(F)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i\\in\\mathbb N}I_i^F.","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists r\\leq|U|\\quad I_r^F=I_{r+1}^F=\\operatorname{IFP}_U(F).","display":true},{"tex":"|U|","display":false},{"tex":"X\\mapsto X\\cup F(X)","display":false}],"bytes":1086,"backlinks":[{"id":"ad67d470dcdc91b8","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{IFP}$ 的膨胀迭代见 [[29-df-ifp]]；下式用 $\\mathrm{IFP}$ 标记扩张语义。"},{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-89","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-ifp]]、[[29-prop-ifp-monotone]]、[[29-df-fo-ifp]]、[[29-thm-ifp-lfp]] — 膨胀不动点及其表达力"},{"id":"bc2571aa42af9da2","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X_0=\\varnothing$、$X_{i+1}=F(X_i)$ 见 [[29-thm-finite-lfp]]；$I_i^F$ 和 $\\operatorname{IFP}_U(F)$ 见 [[29-df-ifp]]。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-83","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-ifp]]"},{"id":"bfe1be5f707cc63a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-ifp|29-df-ifp]]"}],"outgoing":[]}